  "description": "ERECTION OF A GROUND FLOOR EXTENSION, ENLARGEMENT OF THE EXISTING ROOF AND HIP TO GABLE WITH A REAR DORMER AND FRONT ROOF LIGHTS TO FACILITATE THE CHANGE OF USE OF BUILDING TO X2 C3 FLATS (x1 3B5P & x1 2B4P), SUBDIVISION OF EXISTING GARDEN, TOGETHER WITH REMOVAL OF EXISTING OUTBUILDING. OFF-STREET PARKING PROVIION, AND CYCLE/REFUSE STORAGE (DESCRIPTION AMENDED 29.02.24) ",
  "appeal_status": null,
  "decision_date": "11/03/2024",
  "ward": "West Barnes",
  "appeal_decision": null,
  "locality": "New Malden",
  "street_name": "COBHAM AVENUE",
  "status": "Refused",
  "application_type_full": "Full planning permission",
  "decision_agency": "Borough",
  "uprn": "48016528",
  "date_building_work_started_under_previous_permission": null,
  "lpa_app_no": "24/P0030",
